        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 12 Elder Heath Walk to the market a stunning A-rated three-bedroom family home presented in true showhouse condition throughout. Built in 2018 and finished to an exceptional standard, this impressive property combines contemporary design, spacious living and impeccable décor, making it an ideal choice for discerning buyers.\n\nExtending to approximately 101 sq.m. over two well-appointed floors, the accommodation is bright, airy and thoughtfully designed. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a spacious entrance hallway leading to a stylish lounge, a guest bathroom, and a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, flooded with natural light and perfectly suited to modern family living. Upstairs comprises three generous double bedrooms, including a luxurious principal bedroom with en-suite, along with a beautifully finished main family bathroom.\n\nOne of the standout features of this exceptional home is the beautifully landscaped, tiered south-facing rear garden, offering the perfect space to relax, entertain or enjoy outdoor dining in the sunshine.\nPresented in turnkey condition, No. 12 has been meticulously maintained and is ready for immediate occupation, with nothing for the lucky purchaser to do except unpack.\n\nElder Heath enjoys an enviable location at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, offering a peaceful setting while remaining close to every conceivable amenity. Marlfield Shopping Centre is just a two-minute drive away, with The Square Shopping Centre and Tallaght University Hospital reachable in approximately five minutes. The M50 is less than 10 minutes away, while Dublin City Centre can be accessed in approximately 25 minutes, making this an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n- A3 Energy Rating\n- c. 101 sqm\n- 3 Bed, 3 Bath\n- Semi Detached Property\n- Driveway to the front\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Sunny South facing rear garden\n- Show Home Condition Throughout\n- Fully Fitted Stylish Kitchen\n- Ample Storage Space Throughout\n- Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n- Early Viewing Highly Advised!\n\nBER Details\nBER: A3\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 HTW8"
